INSERT INTO `pages` (`slug`, `content`) VALUES ('home', '{"hero":{"image":"/images/ritual-editorial.webp","caption":{"en":"Native grapes.\nIndependent character.","ka":""}},"opening":{"heading":{"en":"From Georgia, with character.","ka":""},"body":{"en":"Born in the heart of Kakheti, we bring a contemporary spirit to Georgian wine. From the soil to the table, it’s a story of character, connection, and a place like nowhere else.","ka":""}},"collection":{"heading":{"en":"The collection","ka":""},"subtitle":{"en":"Selected expressions / 01—03","ka":""}},"editorialCards":[{"label":{"en":"The craft","ka":""},"title":{"en":"A tradition, still alive","ka":""},"image":"/images/cellar.webp","description":{"en":"Clay vessels, native grapes, and knowledge passed from one generation to the next. Discover the traditions that continue to shape our wines.","ka":""}},{"label":{"en":"The place","ka":""},"title":{"en":"Where it all begins","ka":""},"image":"/images/vineyard.webp","description":{"en":"Between the Caucasus Mountains and the Alazani Valley, our vineyards give every wine a sense of belonging. This is Kakheti, our home.","ka":""}},{"label":{"en":"The expression","ka":""},"title":{"en":"Find your character","ka":""},"image":"/images/kisi-qvevri.webp","description":{"en":"From qvevri wines to fresh whites, expressive reds, and sparkling wines. Explore the collection and find your own expression of Georgia.","ka":""}}],"originInterlude":{"line":{"en":"Badagoni\nKakheti, Georgia","ka":""},"caption":{"en":"Local roots. A world of possibilities.","ka":""}},"manifesto":{"image":"/images/ritual-editorial.webp","overlayCaption":{"en":"Wine is a way of bringing people together.","ka":""},"eyebrow":{"en":"A way of looking at the world","ka":""},"heading":{"en":"More than\njust wine.","ka":""},"body":{"en":"A bottle can hold a place, a memory, a conversation. Ours begin in Georgia, with the varieties and traditions that make this corner of the world our own.","ka":""}},"worldSection":{"heading":{"en":"Our world, in three parts","ka":""},"items":[{"title":{"en":"Our place","ka":""},"subtitle":{"en":"Rooted in Kakheti","ka":""},"text":{"en":"Between the Caucasus Mountains and the Alazani Valley, our vineyards give every wine a sense of belonging.","ka":""}},{"title":{"en":"Our craft","ka":""},"subtitle":{"en":"A living tradition","ka":""},"text":{"en":"Clay vessels, native grapes, and knowledge passed from one generation to the next. Qvevri is part of who we are.","ka":""}},{"title":{"en":"Our perspective","ka":""},"subtitle":{"en":"Always looking forward","ka":""},"text":{"en":"Georgian heritage meets contemporary winemaking. An ongoing conversation between the vineyard, the cellar, and the world.","ka":""}}]}}');
